00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:11.639
rebel or whatever.

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:13.739
And I had smoked weed

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:16.229
and laughed a bunch and

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:17.309
thought it was great.

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:19.049
But psychedelics were something more

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:19.949
meaningful for me.

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:21.719
I always had pretty serious

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:23.549
depression issues from the age of

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:25.379
ten years old, I would say,

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:27.029
and they were something that really

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:28.439
helped with that.

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:29.789
When we say "they" what?

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:31.289
What kinds of psychedelics are you

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:32.219
