00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:34.589
Mushrooms were my all time favorite,

00:04:34.590 --> 00:04:36.779
my go to for a very, very long time.

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:37.780
And then

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:41.159
I think if it weren't for DMT,

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:42.779
I probably wouldn't have a science

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:44.879
podcast. I was always

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:47.009
