00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.959
And then when I first

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:50.999
smoked DMT, I became absolutely

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.339
obsessed with trying to figure out

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:54.449
what the heck was that.

